From 273070c0b3801f32824ccd6c3778d8d136c19774 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:26:01 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Fix MQTT listener handlers and update env examples

- inventory handler: remove copy-pasted temperature check that made
  every inventory message return early
- status/temperature handlers: verify the machine exists before
  inserting telemetry (FK violation previously stopped the listener)
- wrap each subscribe callback so one failing message is logged
  instead of terminating mqtt:listen
- correct misleading warning labels
- simulator/backend .env.example: TLS port 8883, credentials, CA path
  and machine id variables matching the actual config

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0122y7ftEnFuvwXT6Cz31oWe
---
 backend/.env.example                          | 26 +++++-
 .../Console/Commands/MqttListenCommand.php    | 81 ++++++++++++-------
 simulator/.env.example                        | 22 ++++-
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

diff --git a/backend/.env.example b/backend/.env.example
index 0f14b7d..9100689 100644
